The implementation was rebuilt for Attune and Keycloak 26.7.1. The direct REST
client, action selection, endpoint paths, schemas, pagination, credential/TLS
handling, and safety controls are new. No python-keycloak implementation code
was retained. The upstream repository did not contain a NOTICE file at the
verified revision.
